From: credentialsd upstream <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Backport credentialsd main v0.4.0..ca77b3e

Upstream commits after the 0.4.0 release that the platform provider
series builds on, as one diff (git diff v0.4.0 ca77b3e):

  457e48b daemon: Offer devices based on libwebauthn's available transports
  00ee5da daemon: rename internal SelectCredential states to SelectingCredential
  20103a8 common: rename Credential.username to display_name
  8881596 docs: fix webext dev instructions and mention Brave

https://github.com/linux-credentials/credentialsd/compare/v0.4.0...ca77b3e
